hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1712","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed bin Mualla (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main masjid mein namaz padh raha tha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey bulaaya aur main ne Aap ko jawaab na diya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main namaz padh raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Allah ne nahi farmaya: (Allah aur Rasool ko jawaab do jab wo tumhey bulaaein uskey liye jo tumhey zinda karta hai)? Phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Main zaroor tumhey surat sikhaaunga jo Quran mein sab se azeem surat hai, masjid se nikalney se pehley. Phir Aap ne mera haath pakda. Phir jab Aap nikalna chaaahtey they to main ne Aap se kaha: Kya tum ne nahi kaha tha ke main tumhey surat sikhaaunga jo Quran mein sab se azeem surat hai? Aap ne farmaya: (Alhamdu Lillahi Rabbil Aalameen). Wo Saat Masaa ni aur Quran-e-Azeem hai jo mujhey diya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 4474). Allah Taala ka qaul: (To Allah key liye shareek na banaao jabke tum jaantey ho)."
